WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:06.915
Purpose and scope 1 Priorities and deliverables Lindiwe confirms

00:00:06.942 --> 00:00:10.823
the current priority list and identifies decisions that require

00:00:10.823 --> 00:00:15.257
her attention Daniel translates the list into a programme

00:00:15.626 --> 00:00:20.955
preparation requirements an action register and review points For

00:00:21.007 --> 00:00:25.073
the Monday example the decision pack and 09:30 preparation

00:00:25.113 --> 00:00:30.271
period are protected Daniel identifies missing inputs he does

00:00:30.284 --> 00:00:34.231
not approve the substantive financial or operational papers himself

00:00:35.113 --> 00:00:40.323
2 Scope of work Daniel coordinates the diary routine

00:00:40.402 --> 00:00:46.784
correspondence meeting preparation travel administration relevant supplier follow-up and

00:00:46.863 --> 00:00:50.455
the administrative interfaces with the EPO and control room

00:00:51.428 --> 00:00:57.047
Office facilities remain with the office-services owner Contract interpretation

00:00:57.073 --> 00:01:01.573
remains with the designated legal or procurement owner Public

00:01:01.639 --> 00:01:07.139
statements remain with the authorised communications function Substantive business

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:09.613
decisions stay with their appointed owners
